      "text": "Heavy Rainfall Warning No. 2 #NCR_PRSD\nWeather System: Tropical Storm RAMIL\nIssued at: 2:00 AM, 19 October 2025(Sunday)\n\nYELLOW WARNING LEVEL: Quezon.\nASSOCIATED HAZARD: FLOODING in flood-prone areas.\nMeanwhile, expect light to moderate rains over Pampanga, Tarlac, Bataan and Zambales within the next 3 hours.\nLight to moderate with occasional heavy rains affecting Batangas, Cavite, Bulacan, Metro Manila, Laguna, Rizal and Nueva Ecija which may persist within 3 hours.\n\nThe public and the Disaster Risk Reduction and Management Offices concerned are advised to MONITOR the weather condition and watch for the next warning to be issued at 5:00 AM today.\nFor more information and queries, please call telephone numbers 8927-1335 and 8927-2877 or log on to https://t.co/59mTpZJq1n.",
