      "text": "[8:45p.m.] #AgegeMotorRoad #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic is good as you leave Oshodi underneath the bridge to Brown Junction Arena, Bolade, Ladipo, Shogunle, PWD, Airport, National, Via the Ikeja Overpass to Ajayi Farm and Ile-Zik. \n\nTraffic back to Oshodi via the same route is all good and our Men are on hand to ensure traffic is seamless.\n\n@Sola_Giwa\n@gm_lastma\n@followlasg\n@GoldmyneTV\n@Mr_JAGs\n@gbenga_omo\n@TrafficChiefNG\n@channelstv\n@lagosMOT1\n@lagostraffic961\n@daily_trust\n@thecableng\n@walemusa\n@seunosiyemi_\n@vanguardngrnews\n@MobilePunch\n@NigeriaNewsdesk\n@TheNationNews\n@channelstv\n@FRSCNigeria\n@OlalekanOki\n@rrslagos767\n@Gidi_Traffic",
